      "explanation": "(1) The organic compound does not react with natural FeCl<sub>3</sub> solution. It means phenolic group is absent in the organic compound.\n<br><br>(2) The organic compound does not give Fehling solution test. It means aldehyde group (- CHO) is absent in the organic compound.\n<picture><source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hv69jz/794f46d9-f5ca-4393-ac12-d1fe43bc1b17/1098c6f0-d601-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hv69k0-320w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 500px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hv69jz/794f46d9-f5ca-4393-ac12-d1fe43bc1b17/1098c6f0-d601-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hv69k0-500w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 680px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hv69jz/794f46d9-f5ca-4393-ac12-d1fe43bc1b17/1098c6f0-d601-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hv69k0-680w.jpg\"><source media=\"(max-width: 860px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hv69jz/794f46d9-f5ca-4393-ac12-d1fe43bc1b17/1098c6f0-d601-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hv69k0-860w.jpg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hv69jz/794f46d9-f5ca-4393-ac12-d1fe43bc1b17/1098c6f0-d601-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hv69k0-1040w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot Chemistry - Practical Organic Chemistry Question 102 English Explanation 1\"></picture>\n<source media=\"(max-width: 320px)\" srcset=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hu6mi0/86c748de-0d36-4314-98e6-c82e378f813b/3177ae80-d5fd-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hu6mi1-320w.jpg\"><img src=\"https://imagex.cdn.examgoal.net/7km5fk0hu6mi0/86c748de-0d36-4314-98e6-c82e378f813b/3177ae80-d5fd-11e9-acf6-6d09a288f7f2/file-7km5fk0hu6mi1-500w.jpg\" style=\"max-width: 100%;height: auto;display: block;margin: 0 auto;\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"JEE Main 2019 (Online) 8th April Morning Slot Chemistry - Practical